      "goal": "Successfully transfer funds between Checking and Saving accounts using the Make a Transfer form. Ensure confirmation and correct entry in transfer history.",
      "feature_area": "Transfer Funds Workflow",
      "priority": "high",
      "starting_hint": "1. Navigate to https://www.ngpf.org/bank-sim\n2. Click 'GET STARTED NOW' on the landing page\n3. Click 'Ok' to dismiss onboarding modal\n4. Expand sidebar menu 'TRANSFERS' by clicking expand_more\n5. Click 'MAKE A TRANSFER'\n6. Select 'SINGLE' in PAYMENT FREQUENCY dropdown\n7. Select 'CHECKING ($216.04)' in Transfer From dropdown\n8. Select 'SAVING ($230.00)' in Transfer To dropdown\n9. Enter '50' in $ Amount field\n10. Select today's date in Payment Date field\n11. Click 'Save'\n12. Observe green snackbar 'Amount has been transferred to Saving Account'\n13. Confirm new entry appears in Past Transfers table with correct Id, Date, Description, Amount",
